   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Aqueduct Veluwemeer in the Veluwe lake near Harderwijk where boats pass over the road. A pleasure yacht is sailing over the road where cars cross the water through a tunnel.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
